# The owner is the code owner of the check, the checker and this file. This
# file alone does not make the owner's review a condition of a merge. The
# review is required only when the branch protection of main has "Require
# review from Code Owners" turned on (see the README); without that setting
# GitHub only asks the owner for a review.
